---
import Publication from '../layouts/Publication.astro';
import Bookshelf from '../components/Bookshelf.astro';
import { firstChapter } from '../lib/books';
import release from '../data/release.json';
---
<Publication title="好身材，不必从健身房开始" description="一本写给普通中国男生的薄肌养成指南。不办卡、不喝水煮菜，把家常三餐和公园单杠变成你的蜕变场。全书四册 32 篇原创实战指南完结版。">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <p class="eyebrow">人人可练的自重健身指南 · 全书 32 篇完结</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">好身材，<br />不必从健身房开始。</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">吃好一日三餐家常饭，把公园单杠和家里地面当成训练场。<br />没有办卡推销，没有水煮鸡胸肉，踏踏实实带你练出精悍体型。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={firstChapter.href!}>从第一章开始阅读 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <a data-continue class="continue-link" hidden>继续阅读</a>
    <div class="hero-note"><span>零器械门槛</span><span>家常三餐不戒碳水</span><span>每周仅练 2~3 天</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="shelf-section" aria-labelledby="shelf-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">四册全书规划</p><h2 id="shelf-title">从吃对三餐，到掌握自重进阶</h2></div><a href="/read/">查看全书目录 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    <Bookshelf />
  </section>
  <section class="fast-track-section" aria-labelledby="fast-track-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">不想按部就班？直接查重点</p><h2 id="fast-track-title">新手捷径地图</h2></div>
      <a href="/read/">查看完整提纲 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="fast-track-grid">
      <div class="fast-track-card">
        <div class="fast-track-header">
          <span class="fast-track-icon">🍳</span>
          <h3>日常饮食怎么吃</h3>
        </div>
        <p>告别水煮菜与鸡胸肉焦虑，教你在外卖、食堂和家常饭里吃出精瘦体型。</p>
        <ul class="fast-track-links">
          <li><a href="/volume-02/01-daily-meals/">一日三餐大白话法则 <span>↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/volume-02/07-eating-out/">外卖与食堂点餐技巧 <span>↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/volume-02/06-eating-for-fat-loss/">怎么吃才能可持续减脂 <span>↗</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fast-track-card">
        <div class="fast-track-header">
          <span class="fast-track-icon">🧱</span>
          <h3>零基础自重动作</h3>
        </div>
        <p>从最简单的靠墙与低杠开始，建立稳固关节支撑，零门槛搞定推拉腿核心。</p>
        <ul class="fast-track-links">
          <li><a href="/volume-03/01-first-workout/">第一次自重训练怎么开始 <span>↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/volume-03/02-push-ups/">俯卧撑：从推墙到标准 <span>↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/volume-03/03-pull-ups/">零基础练出第一个引体 <span>↗</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fast-track-card">
        <div class="fast-track-header">
          <span class="fast-track-icon">📅</span>
          <h3>开箱即用训练计划</h3>
        </div>
        <p>每周仅需 2~3 天，每次 30~45 分钟。第 0 周开始起步，稳步渐进 12 周。</p>
        <ul class="fast-track-links">
          <li><a href="/volume-04/01-week-zero/">第 0 周：测试与准备 <span>↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/volume-03/07-weekly-schedule/">打工人极简排班指南 <span>↗</span></a></li>
          <li><a href="/volume-04/08-beyond-twelve-weeks/">12周之后长期维持模式 <span>↗</span></a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="reading-note" aria-labelledby="note-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">致每一位刚起步的你</p><h2 id="note-title">不用一下子改变全部。<br />今天做好一件事，就已经赢了。</h2></div><div><p>没有器械，就从推墙和标准俯卧撑做起；暂时拉不起引体，就先去公园单杠做死悬吊与澳式划船。三餐吃饱家常饭，别把自己逼成苦行僧；只要每周坚持练够两三天，身体自然会给你最诚实的反馈。</p><div class="reading-note-actions"><a class="button primary" href={firstChapter.href!}>从第一章开启蜕变 →</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/danielsxujiacong-cell/abs-guide">在 GitHub 参与共建 ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <div class="update-line" data-release={release.version}><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>{release.date} · v{release.version} · {release.note}</span><a href="https://github.com/danielsxujiacong-cell/abs-guide/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">更新日志 ↗</a></div>
</Publication>
